      "content": "im just so tired of the math not working out. every single month is just moving numbers around so i can keep a roof over my head for another thirty days just to do it all again. it feels like i'm just running on a treadmill that's heating up and i'm never gonna catch up. like there's literally no version of the future where this stops being a struggle. it's just a loop of working to exist and existing to work.",
